# wrangler.jsonc is generated (DO NOT hand-edit). It is ignored by default, but the two workers that
# own Durable Objects COMMIT theirs: the `migrations` array is the only durable record of a worker's
# DO migration history. The deploy runner clones the repo and regenerates the config from the
# committed one — without it a fresh clone re-generates migrations from scratch, shifting tags when a
# DO class is added or removed, and `wrangler deploy` fails with code 10074.
# Regenerate with `bun run oblaka` after a resource-graph change and commit the result.
**/wrangler.jsonc
!packages/control/wrangler.jsonc
!packages/runner-cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc

# Vendored oblaka tarball staged into the runner image build context (regenerated by docker:prepare).
packages/runner-container/docker/vendor/
